Elena is the owner, chef, and hostess at the [[Geography/Althane/Salores/Toleros/Tidereader's Rest|Tidereader's Rest]], named in honor of her grandmother who served as a state Tidereader for many years. Elena is unfailingly friendly and known the town-over for making the best grits this side of no man's land.

Elena is a female [[Bestiary/Visitors from Beyond#Sprite|Sprite]] with fluorescent orange wings with similar hair to match. She stands a little over a foot tall but flies at eye level most of the time.
